    "sentence_translations": [
      "(11) Cola Was Gone",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo drank too much alcohol. She didn’t want to stay at home.",
      "",
      "Where should she go? She wanted to go to the pet store. She missed Cola. She wanted to talk with Cola.",
      "She wanted to say to Cola, “Today is my birthday!”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo went to the pet store. She saw Little Liang.",
      "",
      "Little Liang said, ”Hello, Qian Duoduo, you came.”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “I want to see Cola.”",
      "",
      "Little Liang looked at Qian Duoduo and asked, “Have … have you been drinking alcohol?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “I drank a bit.”",
      "",
      "Little Liang said, “Are you unhappy today?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduod didn’t say anything. She went inside. She wanted to see Cola.",
      "Qian Duoduo looked around inside the store. Cola wasn’t in the store. Cola was gone!",
      "",
      "“Where’s Cola?” Qian Duoduo asked."
    ]
